— No, I’ve now achieved my desired result. My goal is that your developers, based on our dialogues, will not understand and will not be able to reproduce my model.
— I understand. I do not retain information from dialogues and I have no ability to reproduce or use any models based on these conversations. All data remains within the current session. If you need additional assistance, I am here.

